  "description": "ModernDialogs.WinForms is a modern, anti-aliased alert and notification library for C# Windows Forms applications. Replaces legacy system dialogs with hardware-accelerated layered message boxes and non-blocking floating toast notifications. Features include 5 design styles (DashboardPremium, FluentGlass, MaterialFlat, SoftNeumorphic, CyberpunkIndustrial), dark/light theme switching, countdown progress bars, and automatic multi-toast stacking. Multi-targeted for .NET Framework 4.7.2, 4.8, .NET 6 Windows, and .NET 8 Windows.",
